    "summary": "Added src/daemon/threads/registry.ts (TargetRegistry: one live admin, indexing and unattributed target and one per session; unregister removes all of a thread's targets, unknown threads a no-op; targetFor resolves an identity-less session request to the unattributed target) and src/daemon/threads/status-board.ts (StatusBoard with publish, publishIndexing, publishClients, publishRun refusing shrinking frames, publishStore, snapshot and forget, using today's AttachedClient, RegisteredRepo, RepoCompleteness and UnattributedUnwritableCount shapes; statusBoardHubHandlers for the main thread and StatusBoardClient for workers). Tests in src/daemon/threads/__tests__/registry-board.test.ts, including a real worker publishing through the hub; four falsifying mutations each fail their target test.",
